/S /H1
/P 111 0 R
/T (Recontextualising material)
/E (Recontextualising material)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (Penelope Umbrico is an American artist who works with found images through search engines and picture sharing websites. Her ongoing project Range: of Masters of Photography \(2012-ongoing\), is an unconventional archive that works through appropriation, repetition and recontextualisation of existing material. Unlike traditional photographic archives that aim to preserve original prints, her work questions authenticity and authorship through the creation of digital reproduction of images.  )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1 2 3]
>>
endobj
