<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (Museum of Stolen Art is a digital environment that gives an opportunity for anyone to access Ukrainian art through a website. The viewer is spawned in a floating outdoor space, and has the ability to walk around with an avatar, or even use VR. Instead of being a flat documentation the archive allows an immersive viewer experience. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
