/P 114 0 R
/E (A related work, Pointcloud.garden \(2020\) by Valla, involves point clouds of gardens and flowers, presented in HTML-based animated renderings rather than static images. The works are pixelated moving reconstruction of real places, the titles of each garden includes their geographical location and the names of the plants that are being depicted. In both of the works the artist creates a digitalised archive of real objects and places, with a focus on the visual and procedural limits of digital capture. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4 5]
