/E (Jake Welch is an artist based in New York. His project The Restroom Archive \(2025\), continues with the topic of what can be archival content. The work consists of rotating 3D scans of restrooms presented within a simple HTML webpage. Each scan is labelled with the location and the date scanned as part of the title, which gives the work a documentational character. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
