<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (The structure of the archive is not chronologically linear, the content can be found through listed options of themes. Viewers' experience of the archive involves the encounter of a wide range of personal narratives, without having much context about each individual case. Making the archive about participation, personal experiences and emotions of the participants, giving an overview of everyday life of the people who are part of the archive. The archive has been closed, and the content is not updated. For nowadays users who are accessing the archive, the experience becomes about interpreting this vast range of information, and aligning it with an image of almost unknown participants.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
