204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (After examining the case studies, it becomes clear that unconventional archives act as a separate medium instead of a tool for preservation. They have changed from being stable to always changing and a transforming medium; from institutional authority to distributed authorship; from aiming towards objectivity to subjectivity; and from being a static storage to experimental artistic practice. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
